> "A minimalist and modern vector logo for a social impact tech project called 'MESAFARTAI'. The logo should blend the concepts of food/nourishment (like a subtle plate, bowl, or leaf) with assistive technology/AI (like chat bubbles, network nodes, or digital signals). Use colors that evoke hope, sustainability, and trust, such as vibrant warm orange and tech-friendly blue. Clean white background."
